	"title"		"Reveal StarMap"
	"description"		"Shift + F7 temporarily previews the Spaced Out starmap; press again to restore normal fog. Preview preserves real exploration, so rocket navigation still requires analysis. To analyze the map for navigation, choose Permanent survey in Mod Options > Starmap > Action. Confirmation defaults to once per save; language and notification preferences are also configurable. This permanently analyzes existing cells, skips telescope work and Data Bank rewards, and retains fuel, range and landing rules. It preserves debug/sandbox flags and does not itself disable Steam achievements. Reload an earlier save to undo.\n\nShift + F8 previews the full simulation canvas. Select an asteroid and use Preview map to preview its terrain. Both remain reversible regardless of Star Map Action. Hotkeys are configurable. Requires Spaced Out.\n\n默认 Shift + F7 临时预览星图，再按一次恢复正常迷雾；火箭仍需真实分析才能航行。需要解锁航路时，在模组选项的星图分组中选择永久分析，再按快捷键。默认每个存档首次确认，语言与提示频率可在偏好设置中调整。结果永久保存在当前存档，跳过望远镜工作和数据磁盘奖励，保留燃料、射程及着陆规则，保持调试和沙盒标记原状，本身不会禁用 Steam 成就。需要回退时请载入操作前的存档。Shift + F8 预览完整模拟画布；选中小行星可以预览该世界。这两种预览始终可逆，快捷键可以配置。"
	"changenote"		"v0.4.0 candidate: Optional permanent survey; streamlined native controls; English, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese throughout; configurable confirmation and feedback; preserved legacy preferences. Live UI and flight validation pending."
